<title>NETHERLANDS: Besi Q3 profit 6.7 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>Besi Q3 profit 6.7 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q3 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6.7  vs   7.3 loss</p>
<p>Note - Full name is BE Semiconductors Industries NV (BESI), Dutch unit of Berliner Elektro Holding AG  </p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)	   0.26 vs   n.a.</p>
<p>    Turnover			     110.0  vs   88.5</p>
<p>    Gross profit on sales	     38.4  vs   28.7</p>
<p>    Operating expenses		  27.2  vs   32.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    11.3  vs    3.7 loss</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1.0  vs    2.1</p>
<p>    Taxes				    3.6  vs    1.7</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
